.TH "ROARK\-LIVE\-REPORT\-RUN" "1" "" "roark-live-report-run" "Roark Analytics API Manual"
.SH "NAME"
roark\-live\-report\-run \- Generate a live report document
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.B roark live\-report run
\fIreport\-id\fR [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Writes the report now, for its latest closed period or a custom window (`periodStart` + `periodEnd`, at most 92 days, ended). Returns 202 with the document in PENDING; poll GET /v1/live\-report/{reportId}/document/{documentId} until `status` is READY or FAILED (typically a few minutes). An identical request already in flight is returned as\-is. A generated document is not emailed.
.SH "API"
POST /v1/live\-report/{reportId}/generate
.SH "ARGUMENTS"
.TP
\fIreport\-id\fR
The live report ID
.SH "OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-period\-start\fR \fI<value>\fR
ISO 8601 start of a custom window. Omit both for the latest closed period. Optional.
.TP
\fB\-\-period\-end\fR \fI<value>\fR
ISO 8601 end (exclusive) of a custom window. Requires periodStart. Optional.
.SH "GLOBAL OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-data\fR \fI<json>\fR
Request body as JSON, or @file to read one (@\- for stdin).
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Skip confirmation prompts.
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-input\fR
Never prompt; fail instead.
.TP
\fB\-\-base\-url\fR \fI<url>\fR
API base URL.
.TP
\fB\-\-token\fR \fI<token>\fR
Bearer token. Prefer ROARK_API_BEARER_TOKEN or the stored credential.
.TP
\fB\-\-timeout\fR \fI<ms>\fR
Request timeout in milliseconds.
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-retries\fR \fI<count>\fR
Retries for retryable failures.
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<format>\fR
Output format: auto, json, jsonl, plain.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Shorthand for \-\-format json.
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable colour.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Suppress non\-essential output.
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-project\-base\-url\fR
Send the stored credential to a base URL set by a project .roark.json. Refused by default.
.SH "EXAMPLES"
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
roark live\-report run <report\-id>
.fi
.RE
